-extends "channels/channel_claim_form.html"
-load i18n compress temba

-block pre-form
    -blocktrans with name=brand.name trimmed
      To connect your VK community to RapidPro, you'll need to create a community token with messaging permissions.

  .mt-2
    -blocktrans trimmed
      To get your community name, go to your community page and enter the exact name below.
  .mt-2

    -blocktrans trimmed
      To get your community ID, go to Manage > API Usage > Callback API > Server Settings. Copy the number that
      appears right after group_id in the example JSON in the request verification section.
  .mt-2

    -blocktrans trimmed
      To get the verification string, go to Manage > API Usage > Callback API > Server Settings. You'll find the
      verification string in a section similar to: String to be returned: <code>4412dd18</code>. Copy the string and
      enter it below.

  .mt-2

    .alert-warning
      -blocktrans trimmed
        The API version of the configured server must be <code>5.103</code>. To configure this, go to Manage > API
        Usage > Callback API > Server Settings.


-block extra-style
  {{ block.super }}

  :css
    .info {
      width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .important {
      background-color: #efefef;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      padding: 10px 10px 0px 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .medium-help {
      font-size: 50px;
      height: 50px;
    }

    .header-margin {
      margin-left: 60px;
    }

